  "id": "baked-camembert-with-brioche-bun-wreath",
  "name": "Baked Camembert with Brioche Bun Wreath",
  "subtitle": "Soft brioche buns baked around warm Camembert",
  "description": "A sharing centerpiece of golden brioche buns surrounding baked Camembert, served with cranberry sauce or chilli jam.",
